{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_50_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_50","textTraditional":"一、二十有一年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_50_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_50","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，辛酉，鄭伯突卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_50_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_50","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，戊戌，夫人姜氏薨。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_50_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_50","textTraditional":"婦人弗目也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_50_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_50","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有二月，葬鄭厲公。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}